  "description": "The building is a single-storey, self-contained residential unit providing independent living facilities, including a private kitchen, bathroom, and combined living/sleeping area. This residential use was established following the grant and implementation of planning permission Reference: 03/01609/P (Granted 2003) for \"Alterations; use as a dwelling house.\"\r\rThe property has been occupied continuously and solely as a private residence for a period in excess of 21 years (since 2004). During this entire period, the building has been registered for domestic Council Tax and has been served by independent domestic utility connections. There has been no commercial, retail, or 'Sui Generis' use (such as a tattoo parlour) at this address since the residential conversion was completed in 2004.",
